# Mardu Devotee: "When this creature enters, scry 2" - Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and sees Island and Mountain: the Mountain
# stays on top (drawn on turn 3) and the Island goes to the bottom (CR 701.22). "{1}: Add {R}, {W}, or {B}. Activate only once each turn":
# on turn 3 a Plains pays the {1} and Bot1 chooses red, which pays for Lightning Bolt (Bot2 20 to 17). The second Plains
